---
import { Cover } from "@/components/ui/cover";


---

<section id="home" class="section-hero flex flex-col items-center justify-center">

     
    <div class="flex min-h-screen w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex-col items-center justify-center py-8 sm:py-12 md:py-16 lg:py-20 z-30 text-center">
      <div class="flex mb-6 flex-row justify-center items-center">
        <img src="johann-cp.jpeg" loading="eager" alt="Photo de profil client satisfait" class="rounded-full w-10 h-10 border-white  border-2 -ml-5 object-cover"/>
        <img src="tanguy.png" loading="eager" alt="Photo de profil client satisfait" class="rounded-full w-10 h-10 border-white  border-2 -ml-5 object-cover"/>
        <img src="logan2.webp" loading="eager" alt="Photo de profil client satisfait" class="rounded-full w-10 h-10 border-white  border-2 -ml-5 object-cover"/>
        <img src="romain.jpg" loading="eager" alt="Photo de profil client satisfait" class="rounded-full w-10 h-10 border-white  border-2 -ml-5 object-cover"/>
        <p class="pl-4 mb-0">+30 clients satisafaits</p>
        
      </div> 

    <!-- Title -->
    <h1 class="text-display-xl mb-6 leading-tight sm:text-h2">
        Construisons ensemble un site internet moderne et <Cover children="performant" client:load/>
    </h1>

        <!-- Description -->
    <p class="max-w-2xl mb-6 text-neutral-dark">
        Omnaris est une agence web Normande basée à Caen, vous proposant des prestations avancées et premium par abonnement. Votre présence en ligne 100% déléguée avec prise en charge totale de la création, publication, maintenance et gestion de votre site web."
    </p>
    <div class="flex gap-4 z-20">
        <button class="bg-slate-800 no-underline group cursor-pointer relative shadow-2xl shadow-zinc-900 rounded-full p-px font-semibold leading-6  text-white inline-block">
            <span class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full">
              <span class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(75%_100%_at_50%_0%,rgba(56,189,248,0.6)_0%,rgba(56,189,248,0)_75%)] opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100" />
            </span>
            <div class="relative flex space-x-2 items-center z-10 rounded-full bg-primary py-2 px-6 ring-1 ring-white/10 ">
              <span>
                Prendre rendez-vous
              </span>
              <svg
                fill="none"
                height="16"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                width="16"
                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              >
                <path
                  d="M10.75 8.75L14.25 12L10.75 15.25"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="1.5"
                />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="absolute bottom-0 left-4.5 h-px w-[calc(100%-2.25rem)] bg-linear-to-r from-emerald-400/0 via-emerald-400/90 to-emerald-400/0 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-40" />
          </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  
</section>